{"seq":11,"slug":"procedural-content-generation","title":"程序化内容生成","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"程序化内容生成\">程序化内容生成</h1><p>有限的人手永远填不满无限的世界。一支三人独立团队想要做出一个可探索几十小时的星系，一家 3A 工作室想让每次进入地下城的布局都不一样，背后靠的都是同一类技术：让算法而非美术师逐块拼出关卡、地形、城市与剧情。这正是程序化内容生成（Procedural Content Generation，PCG）要解决的问题——用规则、随机数与搜索，把&quot;创作&quot;从一次性的手工劳动变成可重复运行的程序。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 按四条主线层层递进地铺开 PCG 的全貌，每一章都是下一章的地基。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」回答最根本的三个问题：PCG 到底有哪些类别（在线还是离线、构造式还是搜索式、必要内容还是装饰内容），它的&quot;随机&quot;从何而来（伪随机数与各类噪声函数是一切生成的原料），以及怎么判断生成出来的东西到底好不好（可控性与质量评估是把玩具 demo 推向可发布产品的关键门槛）。没有这三块，后面所有具体算法都会变成黑箱里的玄学。</p>\n<p>第二章「地形与空间生成」把基础落到最经典、最直观的对象上：用高度图与噪声叠加堆出连绵的山脉，用网格回溯或 BSP 切割出地牢与迷宫，再用张量场与 L-system 长出城市的道路网络。这三类都是&quot;空间结构&quot;的生成，共享同一套噪声与图论工具，但各自的约束截然不同。</p>\n<p>第三章「搜索与语法方法」转向更&quot;聪明&quot;的生成范式：当随机叠加不够用、需要保证局部一致性与全局可解时，就要引入约束求解（波函数坍缩）、形式语法（L-system 与图语法）以及把生成当成优化问题来解的基于搜索方法（演化算法）。这一章是 PCG 从&quot;碰运气&quot;走向&quot;有保证&quot;的分水岭。</p>\n<p>第四章「进阶与运行时」面向工业落地：机器学习与生成式模型如何从已有内容里学规律（PCGML 直到 2026 年仍是活跃前沿），运行时如何流式地把无限世界喂给玩家而不卡顿，以及最现实的一点——怎么让设计师和算法协同工作，而不是被算法夺走控制权。混合创作（mixed-initiative）是这一切技术真正进入生产管线的方式。</p>\n<p>读完四章，你会理解 PCG 不是某一个算法，而是一整套&quot;用计算换人力、用约束换可控、用搜索换质量&quot;的工程思维。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pcg-overview","title":"PCG 概念与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/foundations/pcg-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"randomness-noise","title":"随机性与噪声函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/foundations/randomness-noise"},{"seq":3,"slug":"controllability-evaluation","title":"可控性与质量评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/foundations/controllability-evaluation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"terrain-space","title":"地形与空间生成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/terrain-space","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"heightmap-terrain","title":"高度图与地形生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/terrain-space/heightmap-terrain"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dungeon-maze","title":"地牢与迷宫生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/terrain-space/dungeon-maze"},{"seq":3,"slug":"city-road-networks","title":"城市与道路网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/terrain-space/city-road-networks"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-grammar","title":"搜索与语法方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/search-grammar","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wave-function-collapse","title":"波函数坍缩与约束求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/search-grammar/wave-function-collapse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"grammar-rule-systems","title":"语法与规则系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/search-grammar/grammar-rule-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-based-pcg","title":"基于搜索的生成与演化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/search-grammar/search-based-pcg"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-runtime","title":"进阶与运行时","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/advanced-runtime","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ml-generative-pcg","title":"机器学习与生成式 PCG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/advanced-runtime/ml-generative-pcg"},{"seq":2,"slug":"runtime-streaming","title":"运行时生成与流式世界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/advanced-runtime/runtime-streaming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mixed-authorship-tools","title":"混合创作与作者控制工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/advanced-runtime/mixed-authorship-tools"}]}]}